I think so. Yeah.

00:31:20.100 --> 00:31:21.520
And the manual is confirming that.

00:31:21.660 --> 00:31:26.360
400 meters. So for this one, you do have to use both your thumbs again.

00:31:26.500 --> 00:31:32.300
Okay. The game is not possible unless you use both your thumbs to hit the left and right on the

00:31:32.300 --> 00:31:35.660
controller, but you have to do it to a rhythm.

00:31:36.500 --> 00:31:38.180
And I couldn't figure that out.

00:31:38.180 --> 00:31:39.320
That rhythm is impossible.

00:31:39.680 --> 00:31:44.860
Yeah. I couldn't get that. At first I thought it was just, you know, like any other one of these like pretend to

00:31:44.860 --> 00:31:47.900
run games. And I just did it as fast as possible.

00:31:47.900 --> 00:31:52.860
And I was just sort of like trudging along while the computer was blazing fast.

