00:32:18.900 --> 00:32:22.180
And when you switch legs, then you have to switch buttons also.

00:32:22.440 --> 00:32:28.360
Oh. Um, but I feel like I tried doing that the next round and I went really slow.

00:32:28.360 --> 00:32:30.120
So I, I don't know.

00:32:30.220 --> 00:32:32.820
